
# Assertion: assert expectations about a value, raising a kink on failure. The basis of the test helpers.

mask assertion
  head other, like dimension, base self

  task assert-equal
    take self
    take other, like other
    take message, like text, need false
    like void

  task assert-not-equal
    take self
    take other, like other
    take message, like text, need false
    like void

mask truth-assertion
  task assert-true
    take self
    take message, like text, need false
    like void

  task assert-false
    take self
    take message, like text, need false
    like void
